{"id":183,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知性と品性を磨く学習院女子中高","feature_description":"学習院女子中・高等科は、その時代にふさわしい知性と品性を磨くことを大切にする学校です。公式サイトでは、生徒をダイヤモンドの原石と捉え、本物に触れ、過程を大切にしながら表現力を育てる方針が示されています。部活動も運動・文化・同好会まで広く整っています。 文化系・運動系ともに選択肢が広く、学校生活の中で表現力や協働性を磨ける構成になっている点も印象的です。","clubs":[{"id":3393,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3394,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3395,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3396,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3397,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3398,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3399,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3400,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3401,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3402,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3403,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/girl/school-life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3404,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://w